  "about": {
    "description": "FGRS is the SEC-registered blockchain-native common stock of Figure Technology Solutions, Inc. (the Nasdaq listing for the Class A is FIGR). FGRS is the Series A Blockchain Common Stock issued and settled natively on the Provenance blockchain through the On-chain Public Equity Network (OPEN), with no off-chain share registry duplicate. The blockchain is the canonical legal record. Shares are KYC-gated for issuance and transfer whitelisting. FGRS is redeemable for cash or stablecoins based on the Prospectus rather than for an underlying equity, since the blockchain-native shares are themselves the equity. The token is tradable with self-custody on Provenance, with on-chain supply of approximately 809,730 shares as of 2026-06-11.",
